# Production storage/CDN. Bunny Storage is S3-compatible; leave the bucket unset in dev.
# Endpoint format: https://<region>-s3.storage.bunnycdn.com ; region is a Bunny code (de, ny, sg, uk, se, la, jh, syd).
# Set immutable Cache-Control on the pull zone (Bunny does not accept it via the S3 API).
